{"4854180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dig for TCG Cards With Your Friends", "steam_appid": 4854180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗑️ Welcome to the Junkyard — Bring a Friend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere under this mountain of trash is a cards worth a fortune. Dig for it solo, or in online co-op with a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854180/extras/df3caf03047908cad7a5a2755b191f7e.poster.avif?t=1783703777\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854180/extras/df3caf03047908cad7a5a2755b191f7e.webm?t=1783703777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854180/extras/df3caf03047908cad7a5a2755b191f7e.mp4?t=1783703777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🃏 Dig, Sort, Collect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every pile of junk is a gamble. Most of it is scrap — but sometimes the filth coughs up a rare card. Just one more pile.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💰 Trash to Treasure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your junk for in-game cash, upgrade your tools, and expand your search. The deeper you dig, the better the finds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854180/extras/4c5b012de4be6d9373c8734dd82e67be.poster.avif?t=1783703777\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854180/extras/4c5b012de4be6d9373c8734dd82e67be.webm?t=1783703777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854180/extras/4c5b012de4be6d9373c8734dd82e67be.mp4?t=1783703777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person junkyard digging - solo or online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect fictional cards and build your collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell junk for profit and upgrade your tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, cozy vibes with a sense of humor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗑️ Welcome to the Junkyard — Bring a Friend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere under this mountain of trash is a cards worth a fortune. Dig for it solo, or in online co-op with a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854180/extras/df3caf03047908cad7a5a2755b191f7e.poster.avif?t=1783703777\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854180/extras/df3caf03047908cad7a5a2755b191f7e.webm?t=1783703777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854180/extras/df3caf03047908cad7a5a2755b191f7e.mp4?t=1783703777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🃏 Dig, Sort, Collect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every pile of junk is a gamble. Most of it is scrap — but sometimes the filth coughs up a rare card. Just one more pile.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💰 Trash to Treasure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your junk for in-game cash, upgrade your tools, and expand your search. The deeper you dig, the better the finds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\">